WEBVTT

00:07.632 --> 00:09.926
[wind blustering]

00:11.886 --> 00:13.888
[whooshing]

00:20.729 --> 00:22.731
[tense music playing]

00:39.414 --> 00:41.249
[tense music continues]

00:41.332 --> 00:42.584
[man 1] Hey, be careful!

00:44.002 --> 00:45.170
Pull it up! Come on!

00:52.427 --> 00:54.429
[tense music continues]

00:57.390 --> 00:59.392
[music intensifies]

01:00.643 --> 01:03.146
- [music subsides]
- [suspenseful music playing]

01:14.032 --> 01:14.949
[chuckles]

01:15.575 --> 01:16.659
[laughs]

01:17.368 --> 01:20.413
Man, who the hell
does that guy think he is,

01:20.497 --> 01:22.165
bossing me around like that?

01:22.749 --> 01:24.626
Doesn't he realize who the fuck I am?

01:24.709 --> 01:28.004
Boss, you know what it's like to be
suspicious before making the first deal.

01:28.088 --> 01:30.548
Yeah, well, they're not the only ones
who are suspicious.

01:30.632 --> 01:32.759
- We should be suspicious of them too.
- Sure, boss.

01:32.842 --> 01:34.469
Hide some more knives on you.

01:37.722 --> 01:38.640
[man 2] Sir!

01:38.723 --> 01:39.974
[Kim] Here, take some knives.

01:40.058 --> 01:41.059
- Knives?
- [Kim] Yeah.

01:41.851 --> 01:43.228
They're ready to see you now.

01:43.812 --> 01:45.647
Hey, did you get a look at their faces?

01:46.147 --> 01:47.524
No, I couldn't see anyone.

01:48.233 --> 01:50.235
- Not a single one?
- No, I couldn't see anything.

01:51.486 --> 01:53.279
Shit. Are they ghosts or something?

01:53.863 --> 01:54.697
[laughs]

01:55.365 --> 01:57.992
- Hide those knives properly.
- [man 3] Yeah, boss.

01:58.743 --> 02:00.787
- [Kim] How many you got? Two?
- [man 3] Just one.

02:00.870 --> 02:02.622
- [music fades]
- [Kim grunts]

02:03.248 --> 02:04.958
- This way, sir.
- [Kim] All right.

02:08.962 --> 02:10.547
Fucking shit.

02:10.630 --> 02:12.549
God, you really can't see
a fucking thing, huh?

02:12.632 --> 02:14.717
- [uneasy music playing]
- [man 3] There's a bag there.

02:14.801 --> 02:16.344
[Kim] Hang on. Hey!

02:17.011 --> 02:18.680
Fucking hell. Damn it.

02:19.514 --> 02:20.723
What is this?

02:21.808 --> 02:24.018
[man 2] These are US dollars.
What's it for?

02:27.897 --> 02:29.607
[Kim] Ah. [chuckles]

02:29.691 --> 02:31.484
Ah. Hey.

02:31.568 --> 02:35.238
I heard you've been looking for
other distribution channels aside from us.

02:35.738 --> 02:37.448
Why bother doing the work twice?

02:37.532 --> 02:38.658
It's a hassle.

02:39.576 --> 02:41.244
We can handle it all for you.

02:41.744 --> 02:43.872
We'll take care of everything, no problem.

02:45.582 --> 02:46.791
Pick this up, you two.

02:47.959 --> 02:49.085
Oh, uh,

02:50.753 --> 02:54.340
what's this product
we're moving anyway? Huh?

02:54.424 --> 02:57.677
- [menacing music playing]
- [gun clicks, fires]

02:58.344 --> 02:59.345
[music fades]

03:03.850 --> 03:05.852
[phone buzzing]

03:08.855 --> 03:10.106
PROBATION OFFICER
SON OF A BITCH

03:10.190 --> 03:11.232
[sighs]

03:11.316 --> 03:14.235
These guys are fucking relentless,
I swear to God.

03:15.278 --> 03:16.237
What do you want?

03:16.321 --> 03:19.324
[man] This is your probation officer.
I'm calling to confirm your location.

03:19.407 --> 03:20.825
Where are you right now?

03:20.909 --> 03:22.952
Leave me alone already,
you son of a bitch!

03:23.036 --> 03:24.579
Do you wanna fucking die or what?!

03:24.662 --> 03:27.248
Please refrain from using profanity
with me.

03:27.332 --> 03:29.834
I just need you to confirm
that you're on your way home.

03:29.918 --> 03:31.878
You have 20 minutes until curfew.

03:31.961 --> 03:33.588
Yeah! I'm going now!

03:34.172 --> 03:35.924
I'm on my goddamn way home now!

03:36.424 --> 03:38.343
And I'm done talking to you, fucker!

03:42.972 --> 03:45.850
Ah, shit, I swear,
that stupid motherfucker.

03:45.934 --> 03:49.187
He's practically asking for a bullet
in his stupid fucking brain.

03:50.521 --> 03:51.773
[grunts]

03:55.944 --> 03:57.487
[uneasy music playing]

04:05.203 --> 04:06.079
[tense music playing]

04:06.162 --> 04:07.664
- That hurts!
- [Do] Tell me who you are.

04:07.747 --> 04:09.165
Hey! Get off me, man. It hurts!

04:11.584 --> 04:16.005
- [Seo] Was this guy in your car tonight?
- This guy? He got off a while back.

04:16.089 --> 04:17.465
Detective!

04:18.091 --> 04:20.468
We found Jeon Won-seong's ankle monitor
and cell phone.

04:20.551 --> 04:22.887
[tense music continues]

04:29.477 --> 04:31.229
[music fades]

04:35.733 --> 04:36.776
[splutters]

04:41.030 --> 04:44.409
[Moon Baek] Don't police officers
announce themselves before barging in?

04:45.368 --> 04:47.453
And what kind of cop carries
a hammer around with him?

04:47.537 --> 04:49.330
Don't you guys usually have Taser guns?

04:49.414 --> 04:50.373
Jeez.

04:52.000 --> 04:54.085
What's your connection to Jeon Won-seong?

04:54.168 --> 04:57.005
Jeon Won-seong? I don't know who that is.

04:58.381 --> 05:00.717
You came to check on a package
delivered to a stranger?

05:00.800 --> 05:03.052
I really don't know the guy, I swear.

05:03.845 --> 05:06.806
All I know is
I got a package delivered a few days ago.

05:07.473 --> 05:10.768
And inside the box was a whole bunch
of bullets. All different kinds.

05:11.978 --> 05:13.980
[intriguing music playing]

05:21.696 --> 05:22.822
Just bullets inside?

05:23.781 --> 05:24.615
No gun?

05:24.699 --> 05:26.200
What gun?

05:26.284 --> 05:27.994
My box only had bullets in it.

05:28.077 --> 05:30.246
So you came here to look for the gun?

05:31.164 --> 05:34.334
Hey, you didn't answer my question.
Why are you waving around a hammer?

05:34.417 --> 05:36.002
Tell me the truth right now.

05:36.085 --> 05:38.671
I swear I'm not lying.
Come on. Why would I lie?

05:38.755 --> 05:41.716
The package I received
had a bunch of bullets in it

05:41.799 --> 05:44.010
and also a list of addresses.

05:44.093 --> 05:45.219
Addresses?

05:45.303 --> 05:49.807
Yeah. A complete list of addresses
with names and phone numbers on it too.

05:50.558 --> 05:53.811
I was really curious about it,
so I picked an address.

05:53.895 --> 05:56.105
And then once I got here,
I was a bit spooked.

05:56.189 --> 05:58.441
So I decided to hang around for a bit.

05:58.524 --> 06:01.611
Then I saw the guy who lives here
run out of the house.

06:05.323 --> 06:08.368
- Is this who you saw?
- Yeah, that's the guy. That's him.

06:08.451 --> 06:11.329
He must've been
in a pretty big hurry to leave.

06:11.412 --> 06:14.707
He didn't lock the door,
so I walked up, and I saw the box.

06:15.208 --> 06:16.542
Except it was empty.

06:19.295 --> 06:20.296
[door rattles]

06:23.633 --> 06:24.717
The box was empty.

06:25.426 --> 06:26.928
And then you walked in.

06:28.679 --> 06:30.681
[intriguing music continues]

06:34.477 --> 06:36.771
[line ringing]

06:39.899 --> 06:40.900
Hey, it's me.

06:42.151 --> 06:43.694
Did you find Jeon Won-seong?

06:43.778 --> 06:47.490
No. I think that he left his cell
in a taxi on purpose to trick us.

06:52.620 --> 06:53.663
How about a gun?

06:54.622 --> 06:55.748
Was there a gun in the car?

06:55.832 --> 06:57.625
No, there was no gun.

06:57.708 --> 07:00.086
We'll keep trying to find this punk
as soon as possible.

07:00.169 --> 07:02.046
- Okay, be careful. Keep me posted.
- Okay.

07:04.549 --> 07:05.633
[exhales]

07:08.344 --> 07:11.180
This is Officer Lee Do
from Domyeong Precinct Station.

07:11.722 --> 07:13.349
Could you check
the security camera footage

07:13.433 --> 07:15.601
at 45-2 Jeongil-ro?

07:16.144 --> 07:18.229
There was a report
that Jeon Won-seong left his house.

07:18.312 --> 07:20.106
I'd like confirmation on that, please.

07:20.189 --> 07:22.483
[mockingly]
"I'd like confirmation on that, please."

07:24.610 --> 07:27.280
Yes, sir. We'll check the footage
right away and call you back.

07:27.363 --> 07:28.948
Okay, thanks so much.

07:29.031 --> 07:31.033
[intriguing music continues]

07:35.538 --> 07:36.372
[music stops]

07:39.792 --> 07:40.877
Sh.

07:42.962 --> 07:43.963
[door creaks]

07:46.924 --> 07:49.302
[door creaking]

07:50.636 --> 07:52.221
[whispers] Is that Jeon Won-seong?

07:55.850 --> 07:57.185
Do you think he has a gun?

08:04.192 --> 08:05.193
[laughs softly]

08:06.152 --> 08:07.320
[approaching footstep]

08:08.779 --> 08:09.906
[approaching footstep]

08:10.448 --> 08:12.241
- Listen.
- [uneasy music playing]

08:12.325 --> 08:13.159
I'm gonna help you.

08:13.868 --> 08:14.785
Do not move.

08:15.620 --> 08:16.662
One.

08:18.372 --> 08:20.249
- [Do] Stay still.
- [music building]

08:20.917 --> 08:21.751
Two.

08:23.127 --> 08:24.754
- Three!
- [grunts angrily]

08:24.837 --> 08:26.797
[dramatic music playing]

08:30.593 --> 08:32.637
- [phone buzzing]
- [music fades]

08:32.720 --> 08:35.932
Officer Lee, we have footage
of Jeon Won-seong leaving,

08:36.015 --> 08:37.600
and it looks like he's on the move.

08:37.683 --> 08:38.684
On the move?

08:39.227 --> 08:42.188
- [Moon Baek] Whoa!
- All right, keep on tracking him, please.

08:43.898 --> 08:45.900
[dramatic music playing]

08:56.786 --> 08:58.037
[U-tae] Oh shit!

08:58.538 --> 09:00.373
- [horn honking]
- [tires screech]

09:04.293 --> 09:05.211
[rider] Hey, asshole!

09:05.294 --> 09:07.797
[dramatic music continues]

09:16.889 --> 09:18.891
- [U-tae grunts]
- [music fades]

09:19.517 --> 09:21.477
- [U-tae groaning]
- [exhales]

09:22.103 --> 09:23.145
Got him for ya.

09:25.523 --> 09:27.149
[dog barking]

09:28.442 --> 09:30.444
[distant siren wailing]

09:30.528 --> 09:33.906
[Moon Baek] Hang on. Who is this?
He's not the guy that lives here.

09:37.827 --> 09:39.579
[phone buzzing]

09:40.079 --> 09:41.747
SECURITY CAMERA CONTROL ROOM

09:47.545 --> 09:48.796
Did you locate him?

09:48.879 --> 09:51.007
- [woman 1] Yes.
- So where is he now?

09:51.507 --> 09:53.593
Jeon Won-seong was last
seen three kilometers ahead,

09:53.676 --> 09:56.012
in front of Ssangryong Chinese Restaurant
25 minutes ago.

09:56.095 --> 09:57.763
Can you get over there right away?

09:57.847 --> 10:01.767
That's great, but unfortunately,
I don't have a way to get there quickly.

10:01.851 --> 10:04.312
[intriguing music playing]

10:15.323 --> 10:18.117
Officer Jang. Caught someone
breaking into the suspect's home.

10:18.200 --> 10:21.662
He's at 45-5-gil, Seopyeong-gu.
Head over there right now.

10:22.246 --> 10:24.540
- [Jeong-u] I'm on my way there now, sir.
- Okay.

10:27.251 --> 10:28.961
- [line ringing]
- Where to now?

10:29.629 --> 10:31.172
- Hi, me again.
- [woman 1] Hello.

10:31.255 --> 10:33.299
I'm heading towards him.
Where is he at now?

10:33.382 --> 10:35.551
I'm tracing back
Jeon Won-seong's movements

10:35.635 --> 10:38.512
from 28 minutes ago.
That was the last confirmed location.

10:38.596 --> 10:40.598
[tense music playing]

10:41.807 --> 10:42.642
All right, team,

10:42.725 --> 10:44.935
track Jeon Won-seong's
last known locations and movements.

10:45.019 --> 10:47.605
- All right, here we go.
- [woman 2] I'm on it.

10:47.688 --> 10:49.023
Ten.

10:49.690 --> 10:51.942
Nine. Eight.

10:53.027 --> 10:55.196
Seven. What?

10:56.364 --> 10:57.531
Oh, that?

10:57.615 --> 11:00.451
I told you about those,
the bunch of bullets I received?

11:00.951 --> 11:01.994
They're right there.

11:02.578 --> 11:05.998
[woman 1] All set over here, sir.
Officer Lee, are you ready?

11:06.499 --> 11:07.875
Yes, I'm all set, ma'am!

11:10.628 --> 11:11.587
Yes, go ahead.

11:12.338 --> 11:15.466
From here on in, I'm going to tell you
the exact path he traveled.

11:15.549 --> 11:17.968
[suspenseful rock music playing]

11:18.052 --> 11:19.762
[Moon Baek] Oh, watch out, guys! Whoa!

11:19.845 --> 11:20.930
Oof!

11:21.013 --> 11:23.891
In 200 meters, turn right in front
of Ssangryong Chinese Restaurant.

11:24.600 --> 11:25.810
Here we go!

11:25.893 --> 11:27.228
SSANGRYONG RESTAURANT

11:28.145 --> 11:30.064
[tires screech]

11:31.273 --> 11:32.358
[laughing]

11:41.909 --> 11:45.079
- [man 1] I've got him entering Gongwon-ro.
- [woman 1] Put it on the screen, please.

11:46.330 --> 11:49.333
He turned right onto Gongwon-ro 409-gil,
at your four o'clock.

11:49.417 --> 11:51.127
In 30 meters…

11:51.836 --> 11:54.130
- In ten meters, turn right.
- Turning right!

11:54.213 --> 11:56.549
- [engine roars]
- [tires screech]

11:58.426 --> 11:59.593
Keep going straight.

12:00.136 --> 12:01.887
[engine roars]

12:06.517 --> 12:07.935
[car horn honking repeatedly]

12:08.602 --> 12:09.687
[exhales forcefully]

12:12.732 --> 12:14.233
[man] This was taken 21 minutes ago.

12:14.316 --> 12:15.609
IN FRONT OF BOSTON LAUNDROMAT

12:15.693 --> 12:17.111
Make a right turn at the laundromat.

12:19.113 --> 12:20.448
BOSTON LAUNDROMAT

12:23.075 --> 12:25.995
[man 2] Suspect headed into a blind spot
16 minutes ago.

12:26.078 --> 12:28.164
[Do] This road takes us
to the Hojung Intersection.

12:28.247 --> 12:30.499
Search the roads adjacent
to the intersection.

12:30.583 --> 12:33.711
- We should be able to find him quickly.
- [woman 1] Copy. We'll check that.

12:36.589 --> 12:38.257
I think I found him.

12:38.340 --> 12:40.426
He went from the Hojung Intersection
to an underpass.

12:41.051 --> 12:42.011
[tires screech]

12:42.887 --> 12:43.846
Underpass?

12:44.346 --> 12:47.433
[woman 1] You can't access it.
We'll find you a new route.

12:47.516 --> 12:49.101
We're running out of time. Please hurry.

12:49.185 --> 12:50.728
Oh, let's just go for it!

12:52.605 --> 12:54.273
- Turn right!
- [tires screech]

12:57.026 --> 12:59.028
[horn honking]

12:59.111 --> 13:01.447
Describe what he's wearing.
Give me the color of his clothes.

13:01.530 --> 13:02.907
Every little detail will help us.

13:02.990 --> 13:04.283
Bomber jacket, orange hoodie.

13:04.366 --> 13:07.036
[woman 1] Yes, sir. He's wearing
a bomber jacket and an orange hoodie.

13:07.119 --> 13:09.413
- And cargo pants.
- [woman 1] Yes, that's right.

13:09.497 --> 13:11.999
Oh, and he also had
a fishing rod bag on his back.

13:13.918 --> 13:15.878
Does he have
a fishing rod bag on his back?

13:16.462 --> 13:17.838
Yes, he has a long bag on his back.

13:17.922 --> 13:19.715
He's definitely got a gun in there.

13:19.799 --> 13:21.634
[woman 1] What, sir? A gun?

13:22.384 --> 13:25.137
[man 3] Jeon Won-seong turned right
at the entrance to the underpass.

13:25.221 --> 13:26.514
[tires screech]

13:26.597 --> 13:27.723
[Moon Baek] Whoa!

13:28.974 --> 13:31.769
- You think the two of us can handle it?
- The two of us?

13:31.852 --> 13:33.020
Yeah, the two of us.

13:33.562 --> 13:34.897
We're a team now. Come on.

13:34.980 --> 13:36.690
Just try to focus, would you?

13:38.067 --> 13:40.319
- [music fades]
- [metallic clicking]

13:50.204 --> 13:52.206
[chuckling manically]

13:53.749 --> 13:57.211
Ah, Jesus. The fuck am I supposed to do
with these blank rounds?

13:57.753 --> 13:58.963
They gotta be kidding.

13:59.839 --> 14:01.298
He went into the Hyeondae Market.

14:01.382 --> 14:04.301
Go straight ahead,
then take a right at the fruit store.

14:04.385 --> 14:05.761
Then head into the Hyeondae Market.

14:05.845 --> 14:07.054
Take a right here.

14:07.137 --> 14:09.431
[dramatic music playing]

14:13.227 --> 14:15.479
He was seen 14 minutes ago
in front of a convenience store.

14:15.563 --> 14:17.815
[man 4] Visual from 13 minutes ago
in front of a pharmacy.

14:17.898 --> 14:19.650
- [woman 1] Hang on.
- [tires screech]

14:19.733 --> 14:22.152
There are no security cameras
in this area, sir.

14:22.236 --> 14:24.113
We'll check the ones nearby
and update you soon.

14:24.196 --> 14:28.534
[Do] It's a three-way road. Check cameras
near Dongil-ro 34-gil, 46-gil, and 41-gil.

14:28.617 --> 14:29.702
[woman 1] Copy that.

14:32.162 --> 14:33.414
[man 4] I found Jeon Won-seong!

14:33.497 --> 14:36.000
- Can you see the pharmacy sign, sir?
- Pharmacy?

14:36.083 --> 14:38.752
[woman 1] He turned right at
the Green Cross Pharmacy 12 minutes ago.

14:49.346 --> 14:50.264
[tires screech]

14:50.973 --> 14:52.141
Turning right!

14:52.224 --> 14:53.267
[engine roars]

14:54.518 --> 14:57.229
[woman 1] Ten minutes ago,
he turned left at 92 Bakseok-ro.

14:58.272 --> 14:59.356
[tires screech]

15:00.816 --> 15:03.068
Eight minutes ago,
he turned right at 87 Bakseok-ro.

15:06.697 --> 15:08.824
About six minutes ago,
he turned right at Geumseong-ro.

15:08.908 --> 15:10.409
Why are these roads so complicated?

15:10.492 --> 15:11.869
There, 76 Geumseong-ro.

15:13.913 --> 15:15.122
[tires screech]

15:17.124 --> 15:19.752
Five minutes ago,
he turned right at 96 Geumseong-ro.

15:19.835 --> 15:21.962
[woman 1] Huh? No, he turned left.

15:22.046 --> 15:23.797
Stop, stop. That was 96.

15:24.965 --> 15:26.300
[tires screech]

15:26.383 --> 15:27.968
Back up.

15:28.052 --> 15:30.346
- [dramatic music continues]
- [tires screech]

15:32.056 --> 15:33.349
[tires screech]

15:34.892 --> 15:37.770
[woman 1] Once you're on Geumseong-ro,
go straight for 500 meters.

15:37.853 --> 15:38.687
GEUMSEONG-RO

15:44.193 --> 15:45.069
Turn right, now! Now!

15:46.862 --> 15:48.989
- [tires screech]
- Okay, now straight for 800 meters.

15:55.913 --> 15:56.997
[music fades]

15:58.248 --> 16:01.961
So… where do you think
Jeon Won-seong's headed with that gun?

16:02.044 --> 16:05.255
What would you do? Where were you gonna go
once you found a gun?

16:05.339 --> 16:08.258
Come on, stop acting suspicious.
I'm driving you around and everything.

16:08.342 --> 16:10.010
After I get Jeon Won-seong, you're next.

16:10.594 --> 16:12.638
[mockingly] "After I get Jeon Won-seong,
you're next."

16:12.721 --> 16:13.597
[phone buzzing]

16:13.681 --> 16:15.015
MRS. OH

16:15.099 --> 16:16.266
Hey, your mother's calling.

16:19.603 --> 16:21.397
I have another call.
I'm gonna put you on hold.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.481
[woman 1] Copy that.

16:23.273 --> 16:24.108
Hello, Mrs. Oh.

16:24.692 --> 16:27.277
I'm dealing with something urgent now.
Mind if I call you back?

16:27.987 --> 16:29.029
Oh, I see.

16:29.738 --> 16:32.116
I understand. I'm sorry to interrupt.

16:32.199 --> 16:33.575
Okay, speak to you later.

16:34.535 --> 16:35.536
[disconnect tone]

16:36.412 --> 16:37.287
I'm back.

16:37.788 --> 16:40.416
At the end of that road, turn left
at the fork and drive up the hill.

16:44.253 --> 16:46.630
In 200 meters, you'll head downhill.

16:50.342 --> 16:52.636
Jeon Won-seong walked toward
the main street at the bottom.

16:52.720 --> 16:55.264
- Uh, the main street?
- [Moon Baek] Okay, we're doing this!

16:55.347 --> 16:57.141
[engine roars]

16:57.224 --> 17:00.019
Don't worry. You'll see,
I'm gonna make sure you catch this guy.

17:03.355 --> 17:04.690
- [tires screech]
- Oh sh--

17:04.773 --> 17:05.941
[car horn blares]

17:06.442 --> 17:07.443
You okay?

17:07.526 --> 17:08.736
Yeah. Speed up.

17:08.819 --> 17:10.404
[tense music playing]

17:12.781 --> 17:14.825
[woman 1] We have his location
as of four minutes ago.

17:14.908 --> 17:15.951
And three minutes ago.

17:16.035 --> 17:17.453
Two minutes ago.

17:17.536 --> 17:18.746
Keep going down that hill.

17:19.580 --> 17:20.622
One minute ago.

17:20.706 --> 17:22.124
He's headed to the square.

17:23.459 --> 17:25.878
[tense music continues]

17:25.961 --> 17:27.755
We've got him ten seconds ago!
On the screen!

17:27.838 --> 17:29.048
[tires screech]

17:30.883 --> 17:31.759
[tires screech]

17:36.221 --> 17:37.473
There's so many people here.

17:38.265 --> 17:41.143
[Do] Track him on all security cameras
within a hundred meters of the exit.

17:41.226 --> 17:42.936
I'll start looking for him
at the entrance.

17:43.729 --> 17:44.730
[woman 1] I'm on it.

17:46.523 --> 17:49.359
[man 5] No trace of Jeon Won-seong
30 meters to the west of the square.

17:49.443 --> 17:50.360
Sorry about that.

17:50.444 --> 17:52.404
Has he been caught on camera
anywhere else?

17:52.488 --> 17:53.822
We're checking right now.

17:53.906 --> 17:55.074
[man 6] We haven't spotted him

17:55.157 --> 17:56.909
on any of the security cameras
at the exit.

17:56.992 --> 18:00.287
[woman 4] We haven't caught him
on any camera 50 meters to the north.

18:00.370 --> 18:02.706
[man 6] He's not on
the southern-facing cameras either.

18:03.207 --> 18:04.041
[woman 1] Hang on.

18:04.625 --> 18:06.001
This is very strange.

18:06.085 --> 18:08.879
He can't disappear into thin air.
Even though we seem to have lost him,

18:08.962 --> 18:12.091
he'd still have to be walking towards
numerous security cameras

18:12.174 --> 18:13.092
to get to the square.

18:13.175 --> 18:15.761
So, if anything,
we should have better visuals on him.

18:16.261 --> 18:18.388
[music intensifies]

18:21.642 --> 18:24.853
[Won-seong] If you keep watching me
like this and ignoring my rights,

18:24.937 --> 18:26.605
I'm not gonna stand for it.

18:26.688 --> 18:28.690
[music subsides]

18:29.858 --> 18:31.860
[unsettling music playing]

18:32.653 --> 18:35.322
Do you think
he… headed to the police station?

18:35.405 --> 18:36.532
The police station?

18:37.991 --> 18:38.826
Found him, ma'am.

18:38.909 --> 18:39.868
[woman 1] Where is he?

18:39.952 --> 18:42.246
[man 7] Last place we got him.
Disappeared two minutes ago.

18:42.329 --> 18:45.082
You were right.
He's headed to the police station.

18:47.960 --> 18:48.794
What?

18:51.547 --> 18:58.428
GYEONGIN SEOBU POLICE STATION

18:59.012 --> 19:01.140
There are more people out there with guns.

19:01.223 --> 19:02.766
[phone buzzing]

19:04.643 --> 19:05.602
Hey, Officer Lee.

19:05.686 --> 19:08.939
It looks like Jeon Won-seong…
is heading to the station with a gun.

19:09.523 --> 19:10.357
What?

19:10.440 --> 19:12.067
I'm heading there now too.

19:12.151 --> 19:14.987
Get some extra security at the entrance
and meet me in the parking lot.

19:15.779 --> 19:18.407
Uh, okay.
Yeah. I'll make my way there now.

19:30.586 --> 19:32.588
[tense music playing]

19:46.685 --> 19:47.811
[elevator dings]

19:50.272 --> 19:52.274
[tense music continues]

20:05.746 --> 20:07.289
WOMEN AND JUVENILE AFFAIRS DIVISION

20:07.372 --> 20:09.583
[Joo] I think he's here for revenge.

20:09.666 --> 20:12.336
- For revenge?
- I was the one who arrested him.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.465
How many people can bear arms
in the station?

20:16.548 --> 20:20.135
Those officers are out in the field.
Everyone inside is on desk duty.

20:20.219 --> 20:22.804
Man, that Jeon Won-seong's
driving me crazy.

20:22.888 --> 20:24.306
[officer 2] Yeah, I hear that.

20:24.389 --> 20:26.600
Is he trying to ruin our careers?

20:27.100 --> 20:29.019
We haven't heard back
from the detective squad?

20:29.102 --> 20:31.230
[officer 1] They would have called
if they'd caught him.

20:31.313 --> 20:32.981
- [music fades]
- Hey.

20:33.065 --> 20:34.316
Yes?

20:36.902 --> 20:38.654
Captain, can I get
some handcuffs from you?

20:38.737 --> 20:40.614
- Sure. Why?
- I'll tell you later.

20:44.243 --> 20:47.913
- [handcuffs click]
- Whoa. Hey, what are you doing? Ow!

20:48.914 --> 20:50.540
- [Won-seong] Well…
- [unzips bag]

20:51.333 --> 20:54.378
- I wanted to ask you something.
- [metallic pieces jangling]

20:55.963 --> 20:57.923
- That hurts. Come on.
- You stay quiet out here.

20:58.006 --> 20:59.508
- [gunshot]
- [unsettling music playing]

20:59.591 --> 21:00.676
Whoa.

21:03.512 --> 21:05.555
Hey, let me go! No, hey, take me with you!

21:05.639 --> 21:07.432
Take me with you!

21:10.936 --> 21:11.937
What's going on?

21:16.692 --> 21:18.402
How about you say,

21:19.861 --> 21:21.655
"This is your probation officer"?

21:22.364 --> 21:23.323
You first.

21:24.366 --> 21:27.160
This is your probation…
your probation officer.

21:28.870 --> 21:30.289
What was that noise?

21:30.956 --> 21:32.291
I know that voice.

21:32.791 --> 21:34.084
[music intensifies]

21:34.167 --> 21:35.002
It was you, huh?

21:35.752 --> 21:36.712
[officer 1 screams]

21:38.672 --> 21:39.589
[screams] Oh!

21:40.007 --> 21:40.841
[grunts]

21:40.924 --> 21:43.677
- [unsettling music continues]
- [officer 1 gasping]

21:49.057 --> 21:50.976
[officer 1 whimpering]

21:53.562 --> 21:55.564
[Won-seong chuckling maniacally]

21:56.690 --> 21:58.567
How does it feel, motherfucker?!

21:59.067 --> 22:01.987
Do you understand now
how suffocated you made me feel?

22:02.070 --> 22:02.904
Huh?!

22:02.988 --> 22:04.364
Oh, please…

22:04.948 --> 22:06.158
please don't kill me.

22:06.241 --> 22:08.702
You should have expected
something like this would happen.

22:08.785 --> 22:10.329
You've had me by the balls for ages.

22:10.412 --> 22:12.622
I was just trying to do my job, okay?

22:12.706 --> 22:14.082
Don't you know that?

22:14.708 --> 22:15.542
Look over there.

22:16.585 --> 22:18.211
That's what I do.

22:18.295 --> 22:20.213
[officer 1 breathing shakily]

22:20.297 --> 22:23.425
Exactly. So why do you go out of your way
to cause all this trouble?

22:23.508 --> 22:25.552
- Huh?
- Please, no! Don't!

22:26.178 --> 22:27.179
It's just…

22:28.472 --> 22:29.806
I have a five-year-old daughter

22:30.807 --> 22:31.683
and a son.

22:32.642 --> 22:33.518
Please.

22:34.186 --> 22:35.937
Please have mercy on me.

22:36.021 --> 22:37.147
[sighs]

22:38.190 --> 22:39.024
You got kids?

22:39.816 --> 22:41.401
What's that got to do with me?

22:45.072 --> 22:46.823
[panting]

22:46.907 --> 22:48.658
Hey! You okay?

22:48.742 --> 22:49.910
Hey!

22:50.786 --> 22:52.496
Wow, I'm so lucky.

22:53.121 --> 22:56.500
Every single asshole I wanted to go after
is right here.

22:56.583 --> 22:58.418
Jeon Won-seong, drop the gun.

22:58.502 --> 23:00.837
[Joo] Don't do this.
You're gonna regret it.

23:00.921 --> 23:03.173
You're gonna make things worse
for yourself, you moron.

23:03.256 --> 23:04.591
Put the gun down.

23:04.674 --> 23:06.385
You're the fucking morons.

23:07.427 --> 23:10.639
I'd say things couldn't get much worse,
wouldn't you?

23:10.722 --> 23:11.890
Hmm?

23:16.770 --> 23:17.729
[grunting]

23:17.813 --> 23:18.730
You okay, sir?

23:19.356 --> 23:20.524
Turn off the lights.

23:20.607 --> 23:22.150
- You all right, Captain?
- Are you?

23:22.234 --> 23:23.068
Yeah.

23:33.370 --> 23:34.746
[Won-seong yells]

23:36.123 --> 23:38.166
- Hey, Do. What now?
- [distant gunfire]

23:38.667 --> 23:41.670
- One single gun isn't enough.
- [distant rapid gunfire]

23:41.753 --> 23:44.589
Captain, where are the guns
we found in the gosiwon?

23:44.673 --> 23:46.091
The evidence room.

23:46.591 --> 23:48.718
But I thought
those guns weren't functional.

23:48.802 --> 23:50.637
And there weren't any bullets.

23:51.221 --> 23:53.390
- [tense music playing]
- We've got bullets.

23:54.266 --> 23:56.476
- What's the passcode?
- 0-9-2-0.

23:56.560 --> 23:57.686
You fucker!

23:59.104 --> 24:00.063
[grunts]

24:01.273 --> 24:02.566
[distant rapid gunfire]

24:02.649 --> 24:06.111
I'll distract him. Take these officers
and get somewhere safe.

24:07.654 --> 24:09.156
[Won-seong breathing heavily]

24:09.239 --> 24:13.118
Cops always think they're hot shit,
except they're all just shit-eating pigs.

24:19.040 --> 24:21.042
[tense music continues]

24:28.550 --> 24:29.551
Hey.

24:31.303 --> 24:33.847
You didn't think you could hide from me,
did you?

24:36.183 --> 24:37.100
Huh?

24:39.686 --> 24:41.688
[female officer 1 whimpering]

24:48.695 --> 24:50.155
[gun clicking]

24:50.238 --> 24:51.448
Fucking shit!

24:53.116 --> 24:55.660
- [chuckling manically]
- [magazine clatters]

24:55.744 --> 24:57.746
[tense music continues]

25:06.713 --> 25:07.881
[door rattling]

25:18.642 --> 25:19.476
[yells furiously]

25:19.559 --> 25:20.894
Fuck!

25:22.896 --> 25:24.439
Die, fucking bastard, die!

25:25.023 --> 25:26.691
[yelling furiously]

25:27.400 --> 25:28.610
Goddamn motherfucker!

25:32.197 --> 25:33.698
[yells angrily] You shit!

25:34.741 --> 25:35.742
[tense music continues]

25:44.000 --> 25:45.001
[quietly] Come out.

25:45.502 --> 25:47.087
[music intensifies, then fades]

25:47.170 --> 25:49.005
- [glass crackles loudly]
- [Do gasps]

25:52.259 --> 25:54.261
[menacing music playing]

25:56.054 --> 25:56.930
Run!

25:57.931 --> 25:59.140
[exhales deeply]

26:07.607 --> 26:09.067
[Joo groans]

26:13.280 --> 26:14.447
[female officer 1] Captain!

26:16.908 --> 26:18.910
[menacing music intensifies]

26:23.498 --> 26:25.458
- [music fades]
- We have to staunch his wound.

26:25.542 --> 26:26.543
He's bleeding a lot.

26:27.919 --> 26:28.795
What's going on?

26:29.462 --> 26:30.463
Hey! Hey!

26:31.464 --> 26:33.425
Uncuff me now. Come on.

26:33.508 --> 26:35.093
I'm the one who got you here.

26:35.594 --> 26:37.345
Will you please uncuff me already?

26:37.846 --> 26:38.722
Ah shit!

26:38.805 --> 26:40.307
Uncuff me, man!

26:40.390 --> 26:42.392
[approaching footsteps]

26:47.397 --> 26:48.607
[Joo groaning]

26:48.690 --> 26:51.234
- [female officer 1] Give me some gauze.
- [female officer 2] Here.

26:52.235 --> 26:53.194
[groans]

26:53.862 --> 26:56.156
- [female officer 1] Bandages.
- [female officer 2] Here.

26:58.116 --> 26:59.743
I'll distract him and then…

26:59.826 --> 27:00.827
[inhales deeply]

27:01.328 --> 27:03.496
…you shoot him the first chance you get.

27:04.789 --> 27:06.583
All right. Got it, Captain.

27:08.835 --> 27:10.211
[suspenseful music playing]

27:10.295 --> 27:11.129
[beeping]

27:11.796 --> 27:12.631
EVIDENCE ROOM

27:25.101 --> 27:25.935
[grunts]

27:35.904 --> 27:38.239
I got a bad feeling about this.

27:41.576 --> 27:43.036
[straining]

27:45.080 --> 27:45.997
Ha!

27:46.748 --> 27:49.000
- [laughs]
- [Wang] Hey. What's going on?

27:53.129 --> 27:54.631
[whistling]

28:02.597 --> 28:03.598
[phone buzzing]

28:03.682 --> 28:05.016
INSPECTOR SEO HYEONG-JU

28:06.810 --> 28:07.727
Hello?

28:08.228 --> 28:09.854
Captain, are you all right?

28:09.938 --> 28:11.856
Don't worry. We're on our way back.

28:11.940 --> 28:14.359
Don't come up right away
when you get here.

28:14.943 --> 28:16.695
Just wait for backup, okay?

28:16.778 --> 28:20.198
[inhales] No matter what,
do not come up here by yourself.

28:21.157 --> 28:23.076
All due respect, sir,
what are you talking about?

28:23.159 --> 28:24.577
[suspenseful music continues]

28:42.971 --> 28:44.013
Hey, wait for me.

28:44.931 --> 28:46.933
[suspenseful music continues]

28:59.946 --> 29:01.573
[suspenseful music continues]

29:01.656 --> 29:02.657
[exhales]

29:05.910 --> 29:08.037
[man] Come in. Come in, Lee Do!

29:08.121 --> 29:10.582
Unit members have all been isolated.
Everyone, retreat!

29:11.082 --> 29:14.002
[Do] I can't tell who's friendly or not
in this sandstorm!

29:14.502 --> 29:16.880
Abort operations.
I repeat, abort operations and…

29:16.963 --> 29:19.340
- [Do] Please, hang on a minute.
- [soldier] Over here! Help me!

29:19.424 --> 29:22.969
Lee Do! Retreat first!
That's an order, Sergeant!

29:23.052 --> 29:25.430
[Do] There's still survivors
on the battlefield.

29:25.930 --> 29:29.184
If you stay where you are, you'll all die!
Retreat immediately!

29:30.101 --> 29:32.228
[Do breathing heavily]

29:34.689 --> 29:36.691
[whistling]

29:48.745 --> 29:53.041
Man, you know, I used to be
so fucking scared of you people.

29:54.459 --> 29:56.920
Always acting like tough guys.

29:58.379 --> 29:59.380
[labored exhalation]

30:06.304 --> 30:07.889
Like your right-hand man.

30:08.556 --> 30:10.809
That big, huge, tough bastard.

30:11.518 --> 30:12.769
That fucking asshole.

30:13.728 --> 30:16.689
You know he turned off
the security camera and beat my ass?

30:16.773 --> 30:17.982
[laughing]

30:20.944 --> 30:23.446
But as soon as he saw me
holding this gun in my hand,

30:23.530 --> 30:27.200
well, then he started shaking
like a leaf and ran away, didn't he?

30:27.909 --> 30:29.911
Serves you right, you pathetic ass.

30:31.204 --> 30:32.038
What?

30:34.666 --> 30:36.751
You can't run with a bullet in you, huh?

30:37.836 --> 30:38.795
Yeah, that's right.

30:40.213 --> 30:41.756
It's just like you said.

30:43.800 --> 30:47.011
I got no strength left
to try to fight back anymore.

30:47.679 --> 30:48.930
And?

30:49.013 --> 30:50.765
[chuckles] It's just…

30:51.683 --> 30:53.685
[unsettling music playing]

30:54.602 --> 30:57.438
It's just that if you thought
I was gonna beg for my life

30:57.522 --> 30:59.023
from a piece of shit like you…

31:01.067 --> 31:03.778
then I'm sorry to disappoint you.
[chuckles]

31:03.862 --> 31:06.823
[chuckles manically]

31:09.409 --> 31:10.493
Wow.

31:10.577 --> 31:12.954
Cocky right until the end, huh?

31:13.037 --> 31:14.914
[breathing rapidly]

31:15.498 --> 31:17.166
Hey. I've got a…

31:17.959 --> 31:19.711
a little question for you.

31:21.421 --> 31:22.422
Tell me…

31:30.847 --> 31:32.098
how many kids you got?

31:32.599 --> 31:35.310
- [music builds]
- You fucking shit.

31:38.938 --> 31:41.107
- [music subsides]
- [Won-seong yells]

31:41.190 --> 31:43.234
[dramatic music playing]

31:49.782 --> 31:51.159
- [groans]
- Yeah, you like that?

31:52.619 --> 31:53.661
What the fuck?

31:59.667 --> 32:01.711
Come out of there, you fucking rats!

32:01.794 --> 32:04.339
- [music intensifies]
- Stop hiding from me, you assholes!!

32:04.422 --> 32:05.882
Come out here right now!

32:05.965 --> 32:07.967
[funky rock music playing]

32:22.774 --> 32:25.276
[funky rock music continues]

32:26.945 --> 32:28.446
[Won-seong screams]

32:38.247 --> 32:40.750
[funky rock music continues]

32:56.975 --> 32:58.309
[music stops]

32:58.810 --> 33:01.354
[Won-seong panting, groaning]

33:04.941 --> 33:06.693
[Won-seong] Who the fuck just shot me?

33:06.776 --> 33:08.194
Come out here, you bastard!

33:08.277 --> 33:09.612
[gun clicks]

33:10.196 --> 33:11.197
Damn it!

33:11.280 --> 33:13.616
[gasping]

33:17.328 --> 33:21.499
I'm telling you to come out here,
you motherfucker!

33:23.334 --> 33:25.336
- [rapid gunfire]
- Come out!

33:28.589 --> 33:30.800
[grunts, groans]

33:30.883 --> 33:32.844
[breathing heavily]

33:34.679 --> 33:35.513
[groans]

33:35.596 --> 33:37.056
[tense music playing]

33:37.140 --> 33:38.683
[breathing heavily]

33:42.812 --> 33:43.813
Shit!

33:43.896 --> 33:45.273
[breathing heavily]

33:47.316 --> 33:49.819
[tense music continues]

33:49.902 --> 33:50.903
[grunts]

33:52.655 --> 33:53.781
[yells in alarm]

33:54.824 --> 33:55.700
[screams]

33:55.783 --> 33:57.535
[groaning, breathing heavily]

33:58.578 --> 33:59.662
[Won-seong groans]

34:01.456 --> 34:03.041
Shit, you asshole!

34:04.042 --> 34:06.794
You think a motherfucker like you
can toy with me?!

34:07.879 --> 34:11.674
All right, then,
let's fucking go, you fucking pig!

34:12.175 --> 34:13.634
[Won-seong yelling furiously]

34:17.764 --> 34:19.182
[breathing heavily]

34:21.100 --> 34:22.810
Hey, you're that cop from before,
aren't you?

34:23.686 --> 34:24.854
Are you scared?

34:24.937 --> 34:26.731
Okay, now I'm not kidding. Come out!

34:29.692 --> 34:33.404
God dammit.
Why the fuck is everyone out to get me?

34:33.488 --> 34:34.655
[Won-seong breathing heavily]

34:34.739 --> 34:36.532
[tense music continues]

34:38.659 --> 34:40.328
[yelling furiously]

34:43.164 --> 34:45.166
[breathing heavily]

34:48.377 --> 34:51.672
[straining]

34:52.215 --> 34:54.008
[straining]

34:56.385 --> 34:57.804
[glass crunching underfoot]

34:57.887 --> 35:00.098
[Do] Jeon Won-seong, drop the gun now.

35:00.181 --> 35:02.183
[music fades]

35:05.937 --> 35:07.730
[Won-seong] Fuck you, pig!

35:09.148 --> 35:10.483
[yells in alarm]

35:10.566 --> 35:12.985
This is your last warning. Drop the gun.

35:13.069 --> 35:16.572
Okay, okay! I'll do it now! All right?!

35:16.656 --> 35:18.241
Here! Look at it!

35:18.324 --> 35:19.408
Here's the gun!

35:20.701 --> 35:21.828
Captain, are you all right?

35:22.578 --> 35:23.579
[Joo grunts]

35:24.163 --> 35:25.623
Yes, Captain Joo is stable.

35:29.168 --> 35:31.170
[uneasy music playing]

35:34.841 --> 35:36.926
[Joo groaning]

35:44.225 --> 35:46.227
[uneasy music continues]

35:56.237 --> 35:57.613
[unsettling music playing]

36:10.626 --> 36:12.628
[exhales deeply]

36:13.671 --> 36:15.673
[menacing music playing]

36:17.925 --> 36:19.927
[music subsides]

36:22.054 --> 36:24.056
[unsettling music playing]

36:26.726 --> 36:29.395
[Do] I don't wanna hold a gun anymore.
[echoing]

36:30.771 --> 36:32.356
If I have a gun in my hand…

36:33.399 --> 36:34.233
Drop the gun!

36:35.109 --> 36:36.485
Drop the gun!

36:37.486 --> 36:39.739
…I'll have to keep making the same choice…

36:41.741 --> 36:44.744
to take a life in order to save a life.

36:44.827 --> 36:46.829
[music intensifies]

36:46.913 --> 36:49.207
Please drop the gun. Please.

36:50.208 --> 36:51.667
- [gunshots]
- [grunts]

36:51.751 --> 36:53.461
[music fades]

36:54.337 --> 36:56.339
[dramatic music playing]

37:10.353 --> 37:12.355
[dramatic music continues]

37:18.569 --> 37:20.571
[dramatic music continues]

37:40.383 --> 37:41.592
[music fades]

37:41.676 --> 37:43.678
[funky rock music playing]

40:08.489 --> 40:09.615
[music fades]

40:09.698 --> 40:11.700
[mysterious music playing]

41:17.099 --> 41:19.101
[music fades]
